      <VERS vnumber="22"> I will <gr str="5608">declare </gr>thy <gr str="8034">name </gr>unto my <gr str="251">brethren</gr>: in the <gr str="8432">midst </gr>of the <gr str="6951">congregation </gr>will I <gr str="1984">praise </gr>thee. </VERS>
      <VERS vnumber="23"> Ye that <gr str="3373">fear </gr>the <gr str="3068">LORD</gr>, <gr str="1984">praise </gr>him; <gr str="3605">all </gr>ye the <gr str="2233">seed </gr>of <gr str="3290">Jacob</gr>, <gr str="3513">glorify </gr>him; and <gr str="1481 4480">fear </gr>him, <gr str="3605">all </gr>ye the <gr str="2233">seed </gr>of <gr str="3478">Israel</gr>. </VERS>
